OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly bright spells in the east
OL,6,Fwill give way to increasing cloud and
OL,7,Fsome patchy rain from the west on
OL,8,FThursday morning. This will lead into
OL,9,Fa breezier afternoon with some more
OL,10,Fpersistent rain edging into western
OL,11,Fparts later on.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA band of increasingly light
OL,14,Fand patchy rain will move eastwards
OL,15,Facross the region during the evening
OL,16,Ffollowed by clear spells and a few
OL,17,Fshowers overnight. Milder than last
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
