OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,6,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,7,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,10,Fwill be near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSome
OL,13,Fwet and windy weather returns on
OL,14,FSaturday. Sunday looks rather cloudy
OL,15,Fwith patchy rain, though with lighter
OL,16,Fwinds. Staying mixed into next week
OL,17,Fwith bright spells and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
